# The body budget (docs/BODY.md step 2): a hard stretch spends it, comfort refills it. 14 minutes alone of bangs
# from all sides and rough handling, 10 quiet minutes alone (it should stay low: the budget does not refill by
# itself while awake), then someone sits close and strokes its head for 6 minutes (it should come back).
# hard_day_control is the same without the hard stretch.
duration 36:00
clock 14:00
seed 41
room_light on
every 0:20 from 0:10 until 13:50 clap 60 0.9
every 0:20 from 0:20 until 14:00 clap -70 1
every 1:00 from 0:40 until 14:00 shake 1.5
at 24:00 person v enter 0 0.3
every 0:30 from 24:30 until 30:00 touch_head 700
